# Generated by `go mod vendor` (~50 MB) and deliberately not committed. Beyond the
# size: committing it flips the module to -mod=vendor, so CI would build from
# whatever tree was checked in rather than from go.mod — a stale vendor/ would
# change what ships without any dependency change to show for it.
vendor/

# Editor swap files.
.*.sw[a-p]
*~
